    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/e19b0e8470667a4b6ca2b99ff91cd141.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Introducing the very first work of <strong>PePPeroni</strong>, a visual novel team from <strong>Cheese Burger Studio</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Your love and support helps us to create more games with passion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/1fe5b3d2339bca7be4b0e90ccf14d3ab.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You are a big fan of a famous streamer called LUA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0One day, you happen to stumble upon her in the streets by coincidence.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Explore the strange events that lie ahead as your relationship develops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0edb0d94f7c0f9cd9e247143b72c1b68.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played with simple keyboard &amp; mouse controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports various QoL features such as Quick Save/Quick Load and Hide UI functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Message Skip Button(Spacebar) to <strong><i>free up your hands!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All CGs will be unlocked upon clearing the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >* Make sure to check out LUA\u2019s <strong>special outfit</strong> in the gallery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0962a260736246a5796060c0cd120dd7.poster.avif?t=1731657622\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0962a260736246a5796060c0cd120dd7.webm?t=1731657622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0962a260736246a5796060c0cd120dd7.mp4?t=1731657622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/d8f0e887f061b40178dce9ed9d3e9e30.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Hand Drawn Illustrations &amp; 4 Event Scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUA : Live2D Standing CGs / Fully Dubbed Voice (CV. Amano Suama)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event CG : Fully Animated / Multiple event climaxes depending on player choice</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/e19b0e8470667a4b6ca2b99ff91cd141.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Introducing the very first work of <strong>PePPeroni</strong>, a visual novel team from <strong>Cheese Burger Studio</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Your love and support helps us to create more games with passion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/1fe5b3d2339bca7be4b0e90ccf14d3ab.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You are a big fan of a famous streamer called LUA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0One day, you happen to stumble upon her in the streets by coincidence.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Explore the strange events that lie ahead as your relationship develops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0edb0d94f7c0f9cd9e247143b72c1b68.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played with simple keyboard &amp; mouse controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports various QoL features such as Quick Save/Quick Load and Hide UI functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Message Skip Button(Spacebar) to <strong><i>free up your hands!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All CGs will be unlocked upon clearing the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >* Make sure to check out LUA\u2019s <strong>special outfit</strong> in the gallery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0962a260736246a5796060c0cd120dd7.poster.avif?t=1731657622\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0962a260736246a5796060c0cd120dd7.webm?t=1731657622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/0962a260736246a5796060c0cd120dd7.mp4?t=1731657622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256290/extras/d8f0e887f061b40178dce9ed9d3e9e30.avif?t=1731657622\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Hand Drawn Illustrations &amp; 4 Event Scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUA : Live2D Standing CGs / Fully Dubbed Voice (CV. Amano Suama)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event CG : Fully Animated / Multiple event climaxes depending on player choice</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
